<section class="cc-opening">
  <div class="cc-opening-inner">
    <div class="cc-opening-text">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow">A deepening journey</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2 cc-opening-h2">
        More than a training. <em>A path.</em>
      </h2>

      <p class="cc-opening-body">
        The certification course is a series of live online classes on Zoom —
        some already recorded and ready the moment you join, the rest held
        live together — weekly Q&amp;As, hosted practice sessions, monthly live
        deepening sessions with Jacob and fellow practitioners, the Somatic
        Vocal Healing app to practise with, and a global community of people
        walking it with you, wherever in the world you are.
      </p>
      <p class="cc-opening-body">
        You don't have to want to work professionally with this to belong
        here. Many participants are here to go further into their own
        healing — to learn how to travel through the layers of a sound, how
        to meet the line behind them — and give back what was never theirs —
        how to hold space for the parts of themselves no one ever held
        space for.
      </p>
      <p class="cc-opening-pull">
        The certificate is real. So is the path of becoming a practitioner.
        But the heart of this course is the journey itself.
      </p>

      <a href="#register" class="cc-link-cta">
        Find your place on the path <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-down"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="cc-opening-media">
      <img
        class="cc-opening-img"
        src="/media/library/svh-retreat-walk-tree-sunset.jpg"
        alt=""
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
